  "description": "*“Shouldn’t children pay for the sins of their parents?”*\n\nAfter being molested as an orphan by the chairman of a large conglomerate, Nagi has spent his entire life seeking vengeance. When he is just one step away from finally getting his revenge, Chairman Kang suddenly dies. Nagi’s quest for vengeance turns to Chairman Kang’s son, Ho-Su. Will Nagi succeed or will an unexpected speedbump throw a wrench in his plans?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
